title Vinyl: scrubbing the seek bar at 640x480 (a finger held at three quarters: 03:03), then a real drag from a quarter to three quarters of the bar and its release (the seek)
sizes 640x480
# the deck's own density (11.3 px/mm) leaves the approved 640x480 layout's touch rows 70 px, under the 7 mm (79 px):
# owner rule R-4, listed in qa-info.txt; the scene runs at a 3.5-inch 640x480 panel's 9.01 px/mm (the harness's own
# 480x640), whose 7 mm (63 px) the rows hold, the toolkit header as on the deck (56 px)
ppmm 901
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_SCRUB 0.75

wait 1200
shot 01-scrubbing
expect esc
expect text "03:03"
expect text "-1:01"
drag 0.25 0.653 0.75 0.653
wait 600
shot 02-after-drag
expect noquit
